{"type": "/type/text", "value": "In een hol onder de grond woonde een hobbit."}, "latest_revision": 4, "revision": 4, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-07-29T10:48:55.390206"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2026-01-21T18:30:55.688362"}}, {"works": [{"key": "/works/OL27482W"}], "title": "De Hobbit", "publishers": ["Uitgeverij Het Spectrum"], "publish_date": "1984", "key": "/books/OL59690711M", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "identifiers": {}, "covers": [15108065], "publish_places": ["Utrecht, Netherlands", "Antwerp, Belgium"], "copyright_date": "1976", "edition_name": "E\u00e9nentwintigste druk", "languages": [{"key": "/languages/dut"}], "translation_of": "The Hobbit", "translated_from": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "other_titles": ["Daarheen en Weer Terug"], "physical_format": "paperback", "first_sentence": "In een hol onder de grond woonde een hobbit.", "isbn_10": ["9027400431"], "latest_revision": 5, "revision": 5, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-07-29T09:58:00.900153"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2026-01-21T18:28:52.897309"}}, {"works": [{"key": "/works/OL27482W"}], "title": "O Hobbit", "publishers": ["HarperCollins"], "publish_date": "15 julho 2019", "key": "/books/OL58964146M", "type": {"key": "/type/edition"}, "identifiers": {}, "covers": [15027388], "isbn_13": ["9788595084742"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/por"}], "translation_of": "The Hobbit", "translated_from": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "description": {"type": "/type/text", "value": "Bilbo Bolseiro era um dos mais respeit\u00e1veis hobbits de todo o Condado at\u00e9 que, um dia, o mago Gandalf bate \u00e0 sua porta. A partir de ent\u00e3o, toda sua vida pacata e campestre soprando an\u00e9is de fuma\u00e7a com seu belo cachimbo come\u00e7a a mudar. Ele \u00e9 convocado a participar de uma aventura por ningu\u00e9m menos do que Thorin Escudo-de-Carvalho, um pr\u00edncipe do poderoso povo dos An\u00e3os.\r\n\r\nEsta jornada far\u00e1 Bilbo, Gandalf e 13 an\u00e3os atravessarem a Terra-m\u00e9dia, passando por in\u00fameros perigos, como os imensos trols, as Montanhas Nevoentas infestadas de gobelins ou a muito antiga e misteriosa Trevamata, at\u00e9 chegarem (se conseguirem) na Montanha Solit\u00e1ria. L\u00e1 est\u00e1 um incalcul\u00e1vel tesouro, mas h\u00e1 um por\u00e9m. Deitado em cima dele est\u00e1 Smaug, o Dourado, um drag\u00e3o malicioso que... bem, voc\u00ea ter\u00e1 que ler para descobrir.\r\n\r\nLan\u00e7ado em 1937, O Hobbit \u00e9 um divisor de \u00e1guas na literatura de fantasia mundial. Mais de 80 anos ap\u00f3s a sua publica\u00e7\u00e3o, o livro que antecede os ocorridos em O Senhor dos An\u00e9is continua arrebatando f\u00e3s de todas as idades, talvez pelo seu tom brincalh\u00e3o com uma pitada de magia \u00e9lfica, ou talvez porque J.R.R. Tolkien tenha escrito o melhor livro infantojuvenil de todos os tempos. \r\n\r\nEdi\u00e7\u00e3o com mapas, capa dura, fitilho, as ilustra\u00e7\u00f5es originais de J.R.R. Tolkien e um p\u00f4ster de Valfenda exclusivo!"}, "physical_format": "Capa Dura", "number_of_pages": 336, "latest_revision": 3, "revision": 3, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-05-08T21:38:16.239781"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2025-05-08T21:39:54.640349"}}, {"publishers": ["Ballantine Books"], "identifiers": {"librarything": ["3206242"]}, "authors": [{"key": "/authors/OL26320A"}], "pagination": "287 p.", "lc_classifications": ["PZ8.T52 Ho10"], "key": "/books/OL5526619M", "by_statement": "by J. R. R. Tolkien.", "publish_places": ["New York"], "languages": [{"key": "/languages/eng"}], "genres": ["Fiction."], "source_records": ["marc:marc_records_scriblio_net/part06.dat:1853388:685"], "title": "The hobbit, or, There and back again", "lccn": ["67000312"], "number_of_pages": 287, "edition_name": "Rev. ed.", "subjects": ["Middle Earth (Imaginary place) -- Fiction", "Baggins, Bilbo (Fictitious char